<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN TOUR ITINERARY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIAN TOUR ITINERARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian cricket tour itinerary</p>
<p>in England:</p>
<p> May 15   v  Duke of Norfolk's XI	 Arundel</p>
<p>     17   v  Northamptonshire	     Northampton</p>
<p>     18   v  Worcestershire		 Worcester</p>
<p>     20   v  Durham			   Chester-le-Street</p>
<p>     22   v  England, 1st one-day intl  Headingley</p>
<p>     24   v  England, 2nd one-day intl  Lord's</p>
<p>     25   v  England, 3rd one-day intl  The Oval</p>
<p>  27-29   v  Surrey, Sussex or Glos     TBC</p>
<p>June</p>
<p>  31-2    v  Derbyshire		     Derby</p>
<p>   5-9    v  ENGLAND, 1st test	    EDGBASTON</p>
<p>  11-13   v  N'thants, Notts or Durham  TBC</p>
<p>  14-16   v  Leicestershire		 Leicester</p>
<p>  19-23   v  ENGLAND, 2nd test	    LORD'S</p>
<p>  25-27   v  British Universities	 Oxford</p>
<p>  28-30   v  Hampshire			Southampton</p>
<p>July</p>
<p>   3-7    v  ENGLAND, 3rd test	    OLD TRAFFORD</p>
<p>     8    v  Minor Counties		 Jesmond</p>
<p>     12   v  Scotland			 Edinburgh</p>
<p>  16-18   v  Glamorgan			Cardiff</p>
<p>  19-21   v  Middlesex			Lord's</p>
<p>  24-28   v  ENGLAND, 4th test	    HEADINGLEY</p>
<p>August</p>
<p>   1-4    v  Somerset			 Taunton</p>
<p>   7-11   v  ENGLAND, 5th test	    TRENT BRIDGE</p>
<p>  16-18   v  Kent			     Canterbury</p>
<p>  21-25   v  ENGLAND, 6th test	    THE OVAL</p>
</text>
